  "Its README records the build, contained so nothing outside it depended on it while the Smile Wilds stayed the live system. Bodies are authored without faces in folders whose route is their place in the ontology, faces are composed from separately stored parts, settings are written on positions and inherited from the root down, and its first regime reproduced exactly the faces the Wilds already wore.[[r]] Its names followed the figuration of Deleuze and Guattari, bodies, segments, assemblages and regimes."
  "It was committed on 28 August 2026.[[c:043738da]] Across {{commits}} commit, Smile Rhizome tried the form the system later took, raw text and compositions of it, followed in [[t:composition]] and [[t:archetypal-smile]]. The next project is [[p:built-modularization]]."],
